        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>A Hollow's demon arts are not learned, they are anatomy. A Bala is weaker than a Cero and fired at roughly twenty times the rate — which is a cantrip and a focus effect, described in the source material before anyone tried to stat it.</em></p><p>Make a spell attack roll against one creature within 60 feet. On a hit it takes @Damage[1d4[force]] damage plus your key attribute modifier, doubled on a critical hit.</p><p>Bala counts as <strong>agile</strong> for the purpose of your multiple attack penalty (&minus;4/&minus;8 rather than &minus;5/&minus;10).</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
